      <div class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> &rarr; <a href="/guides/commercial-insurance/">Commercial</a> &rarr; <span>Workers' Compensation Guide</span>
      </div>
      <span class="badge badge-trust">Commercial Casualty Standards</span>
      <h1>Workers' Compensation Insurance in 2026: Class Codes, Rates & State Mandates</h1>
      <div class="article-meta">
        <span>👤 Reviewed by <strong>Marcus Vance, CPCU</strong></span>
        <span>📅 Updated: March 2026</span>
        <span>⏱️ 12 min read</span>
        <span>🏛️ NCCI Regulatory Review</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

